# =====================================================================
# Fire Fly Play - Vercel Deployment Guide
# =====================================================================
# Good news: You do NOT need any client-side environment variables on Vercel!
#
# To keep your real backend URL 100% hidden from users and the browser:
# Add this ONE private secret variable in Vercel Project Settings -> Environment Variables:
#
# Name: BACKEND_API_URL
# Value: https://your-backend-app.onrender.com/api
# Type: Sensitive (Secret)
#
# Because 'BACKEND_API_URL' has NO 'VITE_' prefix:
# 1. Vercel accepts it as 'Sensitive' with zero errors or warnings.
# 2. It runs ONLY on Vercel's backend proxy (client/api/[...path].js).
# 3. Users and browser DevTools only see 'https://your-app.vercel.app/api/...'.
# 4. Your real backend URL is completely shielded and invisible.
# =====================================================================
